@SecurityRealWorldExample_HostAddress = http://localhost:5181
@accessToken = replace-with-token-from-login

### Register user; store a high-entropy password
POST {{SecurityRealWorldExample_HostAddress}}/submit
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=alice&email=alice%40example.com&password=replace-with-a-strong-password

###

### Login to receive a short-lived access token
POST {{SecurityRealWorldExample_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "replace-with-the-registration-password"
}

### Get the authenticated user's own record
GET {{SecurityRealWorldExample_HostAddress}}/users/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Administrative user list (requires an Admin token)
GET {{SecurityRealWorldExample_HostAddress}}/admin/users
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
